PPT Expert：
✅ 使用模板：科技感 (tech-dark.pptx)
📋 主题：AI技术分享
📄 页数：15页

🔍 正在检索 AI 技术最新趋势与案例...

🎨 正在生成 PPTX...
✅ 已保存：~/Desktop/AI技术分享.pptx
```

---

### 示例 3：英文 PPT（默认直接生成 PPTX）

```
User: Make me a 10-page PPT about climate change, modern style

PPT Expert:
📋 Requirements
- Topic: Climate Change
- Industry: Environment/Science
- Pages: 10
- Style: Modern
- Color: Sage Calm (green tones)
- Language: English

🔍 Searching for climate change data and reports...

🎨 Generating PPTX...
⚠️ Node.js not found, trying Python (python-pptx)...
✅ Saved: ~/Desktop/Climate_Change.pptx
```

